    "title": "Fluvsies Pocket World",
    "description": "The cute pet game world of Fluvsies is a happy place. But bad guys stole an extra rare Fluvsies egg! A rainbow unicorn cat Fluvsie hatched from this egg and managed to escape. Now the fluffy hero pet is on a mission to rebuild the mini world and save other little fluffy pets. Play Fluvsies Pocket World pet game for girls and boys and help the little hero! Join the hero adventures, explore the world, solve puzzles, play mini games. Hatch cute fluffy pets!\r\n\r\n<b>RESCUE LITTLE PETS & EVERY EGG</b>\r\nExplore the Fluvsies pet game world and find every cute surprise egg. There are 31 new eggs for you to hatch! Have a lot of new adventures with pets. Bring them home and help cute baby animals hatch! Feed them new yummy treats! There are so many new Fluvsies: panda, tiger, and even a cactus pet!\r\n\r\n<b>PET DRESS UP</b>\r\nDress up your cute Fluvsies in new super adorable clothes! Turn Fluvsies into the most stylish little pets in the world! Explore a huge variety of clothing \u2013 dresses, costumes, and accessories! \r\n\r\n<b>REBUILD THE WORLD & EXPLORE</b>\r\nSail across the oceans to explore Jungle, Desert, Ice, Fairytale islands. Help hero Fluvsie make them nice and safe! Grow plants, build mini houses for baby pet Fluvsies, decorate, rescue every egg and all the animals, and fight the bad guys! \r\n\r\n<b>PLAY MINI GAMES</b>\r\nThere is so much to do in the Fluvsies world! Train your brain with Fluvsies pets! Find the items the bad guys stole. Match pets to get a reward! Rescue little goldfish! Explore mysterious temples with hero Fluvsie! Help the cute bird to find its nest! Play dress up with Fluvsies! \r\n\r\n<b>GET NEW REWARD</b>\r\nPlay the game and collect diamonds! Rescue fluffy animals, water plants, build bridges, find stolen objects, and pick up fruit! Play the game every day to get bonus eggs! Complete every mini game to collect gift boxes! Collect keys to unlock new locations! \r\n\r\nPlay Fluvsies Pocket World \u2013 the cutest fluffy animal egg rescue and pet adventure game for kids!\r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\r\n\r\nAbout TutoTOONS Games for Kids\r\nCrafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\r\n\r\nDiscover More Fun with TutoTOONS!\r\n\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS\r\n\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons\r\n\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
